{"id": "04cb14a9-3aa4-44e0-b74e-a8845102d0b4", "slug": "portal-authentication-1", "title": "Portal - Authentication", "description": null, "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Portal - Authentication\"\ndescription: \"Verify your identity to proceed to the control panel.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#10B981\"\n  secondary: \"#06B6D4\"\n  accent: \"#06B6D4\"\n  background: \"#1E1B4B\"\n  surface: \"#0F172A\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Portal - Authentication\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 13; favorites: 2; remixes: 1.\nTags: login, security, input, validation, animated, webgl, effect.\n## Overview\nPortal - Authentication is a Neuform Featured template imported as a reusable Aura DESIGN.md system.\n\nVerify your identity to proceed to the control panel.\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Access Dashboard.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #10B981, secondary #06B6D4, accent #06B6D4, background #1E1B4B, surface #0F172A, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Portal - Authentication</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"text-slate-100 font-sans antialiased min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden bg-slate-950\">\n\n    <!-- Full-page WebGL Background -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-[-1]\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #020617 0%, #0f172a 50%, #1e1b4b 100%);\">\n        <canvas id=\"flow-canvas\" class=\"w-full h-full absolute inset-0\"></canvas>\n    </div>\n\n    <main class=\"w-full max-w-md px-6 relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center\">\n\n        <!-- Eyebrow -->\n        <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-extralight tracking-wide mb-6\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-keyhole-linear\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n            Encrypted session\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Login Card -->\n        <div class=\"w-full bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-xl border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden\">\n            <!-- Decorative glow (1 pixel thin) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-full h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-emerald-500/50 to-transparent\"></div>\n\n            <h1 class=\"text-3xl tracking-tight font-extralight text-white mb-2 text-center\">\n                Access Dashboard\n            </h1>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 font-thin mb-8 text-center\">\n                Verify your identity to proceed to the control panel.\n            </p>\n\n            <form class=\"flex flex-col gap-5\">\n                <!-- Email Input -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\">\n                    <label for=\"email\" class=\"text-xs text-slate-300 font-extralight\">Corporate Email</label>\n                    <div class=\"relative flex items-center\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:mailbox-linear\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"absolute left-3 text-slate-500\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <input id=\"email\" type=\"email\" placeholder=\"alias@organization.com\" class=\"w-full bg-slate-950/50 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg pl-10 pr-4 py-2.5 text-sm text-slate-200 placeholder:text-slate-600 focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500/50 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-emerald-500/50 transition-all font-extralight\">\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Password Input -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n                        <label for=\"password\" class=\"text-xs text-slate-300 font-extralight\">Passphrase</label>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs text-emerald-400 font-extralight hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors\">Recover access?</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"relative flex items-center\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:lock-password-linear\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"absolute left-3 text-slate-500\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <input id=\"password\" type=\"password\" placeholder=\"••••••••\" class=\"w-full bg-slate-950/50 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg pl-10 pr-4 py-2.5 text-sm text-slate-200 placeholder:text-slate-600 focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500/50 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-emerald-500/50 transition-all font-extralight\">\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Remember Me Custom Checkbox -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mt-1\">\n                    <label class=\"flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer group\">\n                        <div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center\">\n                            <input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"peer sr-only\">\n                            <div class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded border border-slate-700 bg-slate-950 peer-checked:bg-emerald-500 peer-checked:border-emerald-500 transition-colors group-hover:border-slate-500\"></div>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-linear\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"absolute text-slate-950 opacity-0 peer-checked:opacity-100 transition-opacity pointer-events-none\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 font-extralight group-hover:text-slate-300 transition-colors\">Keep session active</span>\n                    </label>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Submit -->\n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"w-full py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500 text-slate-950 text-sm font-light hover:bg-emerald-400 transition-colors mt-2 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(16,185,129,0.15)] hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(16,185,129,0.25)]\">\n                    Authenticate\n                </button>\n            </form>\n\n            <!-- Divider -->\n            <div class=\"mt-6 mb-6 flex items-center gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"h-px bg-slate-800 flex-1\"></div>\n                <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-thin\">or authenticate via</span>\n                <div class=\"h-px bg-slate-800 flex-1\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- OAuth Buttons -->\n            <div class=\"flex gap-3\">\n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"flex-1 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-950/50 border border-slate-800 text-slate-300 text-sm font-extralight hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:code-circle-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    Repository\n                </button>\n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"flex-1 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-950/50 border border-slate-800 text-slate-300 text-sm font-extralight hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cloud-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    Workspace\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // Canvas Animation with Mouse Attraction\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('flow-canvas');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n        let width, height, dpr;\n        let time = 0;\n\n        // Mouse tracking variables\n        let targetMouseX = -1000;\n        let targetMouseY = -1000;\n        let mouseX = -1000;\n        let mouseY = -1000;\n\n        function initCanvas() {\n            dpr = window.devicePixelRatio || 1;\n            const rect = canvas.parentElement.getBoundingClientRect();\n            width = rect.width;\n            height = rect.height;\n            canvas.width = width * dpr;\n            canvas.height = height * dpr;\n            ctx.scale(dpr, dpr);\n        }\n\n        window.addEventListener('resize', initCanvas);\n        initCanvas();\n\n        window.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n            targetMouseX = e.clientX;\n            targetMouseY = e.clientY;\n        });\n\n        const linesCount = 75;\n        const lines = Array.from({ length: linesCount }, (_, i) => ({\n            yNorm: (i / (linesCount - 1)) * 2 - 1,\n            speed: 0.003 + Math.random() * 0.008,\n            offset: Math.random() * Math.PI * 2,\n            opacity: 0.15 + Math.random() * 0.4,\n            // Staggered pull distance: causes lines to attract one by one from far away\n            pullDist: 400 + Math.random() * 800\n        }));\n\n        function render() {\n            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n            time += 1;\n\n            // Smooth mouse interpolation\n            mouseX += (targetMouseX - mouseX) * 0.1;\n            mouseY += (targetMouseY - mouseY) * 0.1;\n\n            const centerY = height / 2;\n            const centerX = width / 2;\n\n            const gradient = ctx.createLinearGradient(width * 0.1, 0, width * 0.9, 0);\n            gradient.addColorStop(0, '#10b981');\n            gradient.addColorStop(0.5, '#06b6d4');\n            gradient.addColorStop(1, '#8b5cf6');\n\n            const pullStrength = 0.85;\n\n            lines.forEach((line) => {\n                const wave = Math.sin(time * line.speed + line.offset) * 12;\n                const verticalSpread = height * 0.35;\n                const baseStartY = centerY + (line.yNorm * verticalSpread) + wave;\n\n                const baseStartX = width * 0.05;\n                const baseEndX = width * 0.95;\n\n                // Calculate attraction for left end using staggered distance\n                let leftX = baseStartX;\n                let leftY = baseStartY;\n                const distLeft = Math.hypot(mouseX - leftX, mouseY - leftY);\n                if (distLeft < line.pullDist) {\n                    const force = Math.pow(1 - distLeft / line.pullDist, 2) * pullStrength;\n                    leftX += (mouseX - leftX) * force;\n                    leftY += (mouseY - leftY) * force;\n                }\n\n                // Calculate attraction for right end using staggered distance\n                let rightX = baseEndX;\n                let rightY = baseStartY;\n                const distRight = Math.hypot(mouseX - rightX, mouseY - rightY);\n                if (distRight < line.pullDist) {\n                    const force = Math.pow(1 - distRight / line.pullDist, 2) * pullStrength;\n                    rightX += (mouseX - rightX) * force;\n                    rightY += (mouseY - rightY) * force;\n                }\n\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.moveTo(leftX, leftY);\n\n                const pinchY = centerY + (line.yNorm * verticalSpread * 0.05);\n\n                ctx.bezierCurveTo(\n                    width * 0.35, leftY,\n                    width * 0.45, pinchY,\n                    centerX, pinchY\n                );\n\n                ctx.bezierCurveTo(\n                    width * 0.55, pinchY,\n                    width * 0.65, rightY,\n                    rightX, rightY\n                );\n\n                ctx.strokeStyle = gradient;\n                ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n                ctx.globalAlpha = line.opacity;\n                ctx.stroke();\n\n                ctx.globalAlpha = line.opacity + 0.3;\n                ctx.fillStyle = '#34d399';\n\n                // Draw dots at the dynamically attracted endpoints\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.arc(leftX, leftY, 1.5, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                ctx.fill();\n\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.arc(rightX, rightY, 1.5, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                ctx.fill();\n            });\n\n            ctx.globalAlpha = 1;\n            requestAnimationFrame(render);\n        }\n\n        render();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "portal-authentication-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/portal-authentication-1.jpg", "source_name": "portal-authentication-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 87, "forks": 3, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T11:52:40.741837+00:00"}